<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>In this world full of thorns, let me not be overcome,</l><l>For I am meek and only seeking to thrive,</l><l>Living for Your glory; to Your image conform,</l><l>A reflection of You.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Like lilies of the field, I’ll worry not, nor fear,</l><l>For You have provided for all my needs here.</l><l>I’ll trust in You alone—Hope, Rock, Foundation,</l><l>Joy of my salvation.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
